OL,3,GNEWSAMan who hid arson attack suspect's
OL,4,Abody in bin jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who admitted hiding a man's body
OL,7,Fin a wheelie bin has been jailed.
OL,9,FThe body of Paul Smith, 40, known as
OL,10,FSmigger, was found in the bin in
OL,11,FEverton, Liverpool, on 22 July last
OL,12,Fyear, seven days after he was believed
OL,13,Fto have started a fire at the home of
OL,14,FSheila Jackson, 83, and her partner
OL,15,FEric Greener, 77, in St Helens,
OL,16,FMerseyside.
OL,18,FThe couple were rescued from the blaze
OL,19,Fbut died in hospital from burns and
OL,20,Fsmoke inhalation.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
