OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan who hid arson attack suspect's
OL,4,Abody in bin jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteven Wales, 61, was jailed for two
OL,7,Fyears and four months at Liverpool
OL,8,FCrown Court after the court heard he
OL,9,Fhad found Smith's body in his bath and
OL,10,Fmoved it into the bin, which he hid
OL,11,Fbehind nearby derelict houses.
